sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor C as Customer
participant B as Payment Bank
participant R as RAAST
participant O as Open Connect (RSOP)
participant G as Government Biller (Mock)
C->>B: Confirm bill payment
B->>R: PACS.008 (inquiry identifier, amount, payment reference)
R->>O: Forward PACS.008 with same identifier and amount
O->>O: Retrieve inquiry and validate identifier and amount pair<br/>Check inquiry is eligible for payment
alt RSOP validation failed
O-->>R: PACS.002 / NAUTH (rejection reason)
R->>R: Reject transaction
par Notify Payment Bank
R-->>B: PACS.002 / RJCT
B-->>C: Payment rejected
and Notify RSOP
R-->>O: PACS.002 / RJCT
O->>O: Mark payment attempt REJECTED
end
Note over O,G: Do not call Bill Marking web service
else RSOP validation successful
O->>O: Reserve inquiry for this payment<br/>Set status AWAITING_ACSP
O-->>R: PACS.002 / AUTH
R->>R: Accept and settle transaction
par Notify Payment Bank
R-->>B: PACS.002 / ACSP
B-->>C: Payment successful
and Notify RSOP
R-->>O: PACS.002 / ACSP
O->>O: Correlate payment and mark payment DONE<br/>Persist bill-marking task
end
O->>G: Call mock Bill Marking web service<br/>(inquiry identifier, amount, payment reference)
G->>G: Mark bill paid idempotently
G-->>O: Bill marking confirmation
O->>O: Mark bill notification COMPLETE
end
